{'symbol': 'HON', 'date': '2021-12-02 08:12:00', 'title': "HONEYWELL'S NEW AIR MONITOR ALERTS WHEN INDOOR CONDITIONS MAY PRESENT INCREASED RISK FACTORS FOR EXPOSURE TO AIRBORNE VIRUSES", 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., DEC. 2, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0HONEYWELL (NASDAQ: HON) TODAY ANNOUNCED A NEW, USER-FRIENDLY MONITOR THAT ALERTS USERS WHEN INDOOR AIR CONDITIONS MAY PRESENT AN INCREASED RISK OF POTENTIALLY TRANSMITTING AIRBORNE VIRUSES IN SCHOOLS, RESTAURANTS AND OTHER SPACES.'}